  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is BKC known for?",
      "answer": "BKC (Bandra Kurla Complex) is Mumbai's premier planned business district, home to the headquarters of major banks and MNCs, the National Stock Exchange (NSE), the Bharat Diamond Bourse, the US Consulate, the Jio World Centre and MMRDA Grounds for major concerts and events."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of BKC?",
      "answer": "BKC primarily uses the pin code 400051 (Bandra East / BKC), with parts under 400098 (Kalina / Santacruz East side) and 400070 (Kurla side)."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within BKC?",
      "answer": "BKC is organised into planned blocks - G Block (banks, MNCs, NSE), E Block (Diamond Bourse, consulates), the Jio World Centre / Maker Maxity belt, and fringe residential pockets like Bharat Nagar, Kalanagar and the Kurla-side edge."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in BKC?",
      "answer": "BKC is primarily commercial. Grade A office space leases at ₹250–₹450 per sqft per month, among Mumbai's highest. Residential options on the fringe (Bharat Nagar / Kalanagar) range from ₹2.5 Cr for a 2BHK to ₹6–10 Cr+ for premium apartments, with rents from ₹60,000 to ₹2,50,000+ per month (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute to BKC?",
      "answer": "BKC is served by the Mumbai Metro (Line 2B / Line 3 underground stations), nearby Bandra and Kurla railway stations, the BKC bus depot and BEST routes, and direct access via the BKC Connector, SCLR, the Eastern Express Highway and the Western Express Highway."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hotels are in BKC?",
      "answer": "Major hotels in BKC include Trident BKC, Sofitel Mumbai BKC, The St. Regis (nearby Lower Parel) connections, and several business hotels and serviced apartments catering to corporate travellers."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are near BKC?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals near BKC include Asian Heart Institute (within BKC), Sir H.N. Reliance Foundation Hospital (nearby), Holy Family Hospital (Bandra), and Guru Nanak Hospital (Bandra East)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best restaurants in BKC?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's BKC listings, read reviews from locals and professionals, and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy."
    }
